.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wordCount()
reads through the file stream pointed to by
.I file
and counts the number of lines, words, and characters it contains,
storing the results in
.IR lines ,
.IR words ,
and
.IR chars
respectively.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, and \-1 on failure.
